I go to the billing counter.
I have three items in my hand.
A yellow kurti, a large white shawl, and red pants.
I put these clothes on the counter.
The cashier looks at the clothes.
He calculates the total price.
The cashier speaks to me.
"The total is one thousand six hundred rupees."
I give him the money.
He puts the clothes in a large bag.
The cashier gives me the bag.
I take my bag.
These new clothes are good to wear.
I walk out of the shop.
